y version of the name. It is usually all lowercase and contains only letters, numbers, and underscores.'=>'“slug” 是名稱的 URL 友好版本。它通常是全小寫，並且只包含字母、數字和底線。','DO NOT EDIT the taxonomy slug unless also planning to migrate terms. Changing the slug registers a new taxonomy entry.'=>'除非計劃遷移術語，否則請勿編輯 taxonomy slug。更改 slug 將註冊一個新的 taxonomy 條目。','Migrate terms to newly renamed taxonomy?'=>'將術語遷移到新命名的 taxonomy 嗎？','(e.g. Jobs)'=>'(例如：工作)','Plural Label'=>'複數標籤','(e.g. Job)'=>'(例如：工作)','Singular Label'=>'單數標籤','Parent-Child Relationships'=>'父子關係','Can terms in this taxonomy be organized into hierarchical relationships?'=>'這個 taxonomy 的術語能否組織成層級關係？','Description'=>'描述','Describe what your taxonomy is used for.'=>'描述您的 taxonomy 的用途。','Default Terms'=>'預設術語','Set the default terms for this taxonomy. These will be automatically added to all new posts. Enter the term names or slugs. Separate multiple terms with by comma.'=>'為這個 taxonomy 設定預設術語。這些術語將自動添加到所有新文章中。請輸入術語名稱或 slug。用逗號分隔多個術語。','Archive page result'=>'存檔頁結果','Normally, WordPress will only show one post type on taxonomy archive pages. Enable this feature to show content from all selected posts types.'=>'通常，WordPress 只會在 taxonomy 存檔頁面上顯示一種 post type。啟用此功能以顯示來自所有選定 post types 的內容。','Rewrite'=>'重寫','WordPress can use a custom permalink for this taxonomy. It does not have to match the slug.'=>'WordPress 可以為這個 taxonomy 使用自定義永久連結。它不必與 slug 匹配。','(default: taxonomy name)'=>'(預設：taxonomy 名稱)','Custom Rewrite Slug'=>'自定義重寫 slug','Custom taxonomy rewrite slug.'=>'自定義 taxonomy 重寫 slug。','Rewrite With Front'=>'前綴重寫','Should the permastruct be prepended with the front base.'=>'永久結構是否應該以前綴基礎。','Rewrite Hierarchical'=>'重寫層級','Should the permastruct allow hierarchical urls.'=>'永久結構是否應該允許層級 URL。','Show user interface'=>'顯示使用者介面','Should there be a visible interface in the WordPress admin area to manage these terms?'=>'在 WordPress 管理區域中是否應該有可見的介面來管理這些術語？','Show in admin menus'=>'在管理菜單中顯示','Should there be links to this taxonomy in the WordPress admin menus?'=>'在 WordPress 管理菜單中應該有指向此 taxonomy 的連結嗎？','Show in frontend menus'=>'在前端菜單中顯示','Should this taxonomy be available for the frontend “Menus” and “Navigation” options?'=>'此 taxonomy 應該可用於前端的「菜單」和「導航」選項嗎？','Show admin column'=>'顯示管理欄','Should a column for this taxonomy appear on screens such as “Posts” and “Pages”?'=>'在「文章」和「頁面」等螢幕上應該出現此 taxonomy 的欄位嗎？','Show in "Quick Edit" and "Bulk Edit"'=>'在 "快速編輯" 和 "批量編輯" 中顯示','Should this taxonomy be available in editing tools on screens such as “Posts” and “Pages”?'=>'此 taxonomy 應該在「文章」和「頁面」等螢幕的編輯工具中可用嗎？','Show in Filter'=>'在篩選器中顯示','Should this taxonomy be available in filters on screens such as “Posts” and “Pages”?'=>'此 taxonomy 應該在「文章」和「頁面」等螢幕的篩選器中可用嗎？','Menu Name'=>'菜單名稱','Custom admin menu name for your taxonomy.'=>'您 taxonomy 的自訂管理菜單名稱。','(e.g. All Jobs)'=>'(例如：所有工作)','All Items'=>'所有項目','Used as tab text when showing all terms for hierarchical taxonomy while editing post.'=>'用於編輯文章時顯示所有層級 taxonomy 文字的標籤文本。','(e.g. Edit Job)'=>'(例如：編輯工作)','Edit Item'=>'編輯項目','Used at the top of the term editor screen for an existing taxonomy term.'=>'用於現有 taxonomy 文字的文字編輯器螢幕頂部。','(e.g. View Job)'=>'(例如：查看工作)','View Item'=>'查看項目','Used in the admin bar when viewing editor screen for an existing taxonomy term.'=>'在管理工具列中查看現有分類術語的編輯器畫面時使用。','(e.g. Update Job Name)'=>'(例如：更新工作名稱)','Update Item Name'=>'更新項目名稱','Custom taxonomy label. Used in the admin menu for displaying taxonomies.'=>'自定義分類術語標籤。在管理菜單中顯示分類術語時使用。','Update %s name'=>'更新 %s 名稱','(e.g. Add New Job)'=>'(例如：新增工作)','Add New Item'=>'新增項目','Used at the top of the term editor screen and button text for a new taxonomy term.'=>'用於分類術語的編輯器畫面頂部和新分類術語的按鈕文本。','(e.g. New Job Name)'=>'(例如：新工作名稱)','New Item Name'=>'新項目名稱','(e.g. Parent Job)'=>'(例如：父工作)','Parent Item'=>'父項目','(e.g. Parent Job:)'=>'(例如：父工作：)','Parent Item Colon'=>'父項目冒號','(e.g. Search Jobs)'=>'(例如：搜尋工作)','Search Items'=>'搜尋項目','(e.g. Popular Jobs)'=>'(例如：熱門工作)','Popular Items'=>'熱門項目','(e.g. Separate Jobs with commas)'